  "title": "Aware Sets Third Quarter 2025 Webcast for Wednesday, October 29, 2025, at 5:00 p.m. Eastern Time",
  "summary": "BURLINGTON, MASS. – October 15, 2025 – Aware, Inc. (NASDAQ: AWRE), global leader in biometric identity and authentication solutions, will hold a webcast on Wednesday, October 29, 2025, at 5:00 p.m. Eastern time to discuss its financial results for the third quarter ended September 30, 2025. Financial results will be issued in a press release before the call. […]",
